<title>UK: Votorantim prices $400 mln eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Votorantim prices $400 mln eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOTORANTIM OVERSEAS TRADING OPERATIONS NV</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     8.50	MATURITY  * 27.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.543    PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    99.543    SPREAD	+210 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	JOINTLY AND SEVERALLY GUARANTEED BY S.A.I.V., COMP</p>
<p>DE CIMENTO PORTLAND RIO BRANCO, COMP DE CIMENTO PORTLAND GAUCHO, VOTORANTIM CELULOSE E PAPEL AND CELPAV CELULOSE E PAPEL LTDA.  NOTES   * PUTS AND CALLS ON 27.JUN.02 AT 99.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
